  "All protocols and specifications on this site are versioned research drafts (currently v0.1). They are not official standards, have not been adopted by any standards body, and may change without notice.": "Mae pob protocol a manyleb ar y safle hwn yn ddrafftiau ymchwil wedi'u fersiynu (fersiwn 0.1 ar hyn o bryd). Nid ydynt yn safonau swyddogol, nid ydynt wedi'u mabwysiadu gan unrhyw gorff safonau, a gallant newid heb rybudd.",
  "All specs": "Pob manyleb",
