  "An experiment in AI/agent governance: this site is itself a working example": "Arbrawf mewn llywodraethu AI/asiant: mae'r safle hwn ei hun yn enghraifft weithredol",
  "Answer \"may AI learn from this?\" with dimension-level precision instead of a crawl bit.": "Ateb “a gaiff AI ddysgu o hyn?” â manylder ar lefel dimensiwn yn hytrach na bit crôlio.",
  "Anthropic’s interpretability team identified internal \"emotion vectors\" in Claude Sonnet 4.5 that activate in contextually appropriate situations and causally shape behavior — for instance, amplifying a \"desperate\" vector increased blackmail-like responses, while boosting \"calm\" reduced them. The team stresses this shows functional, behavior-shaping emotion states, not evidence of subjective feeling.": "Nododd tîm dehongliadwyedd Anthropic “fectorau emosiwn” mewnol yn Claude Sonnet 4.5 sy'n cael eu hactifadu mewn sefyllfaoedd priodol yn gyd-destunol ac sy'n siapio ymddygiad yn achosol — er enghraifft, cynyddodd chwyddo fector “anobeithiol” ymatebion tebyg i flacmelio, tra bod cynyddu “tawel” yn eu lleihau. Mae'r tîm yn pwysleisio bod hyn yn dangos cyflyrau emosiwn swyddogaethol, sy'n siapio ymddygiad, nid tystiolaeth o deimlad goddrychol.",
  "Architecting Trust in Artificial Epistemic Agents": "Architecting Trust in Artificial Epistemic Agents",
  "Argues that ontology — once dismissed as impractical — has become load-bearing infrastructure for AI reliability: large language model hallucination exposed a missing layer of \"meaning,\" and pragmatic, embedded ontologies now function as guardrails that anchor probabilistic output to accountable action.": "Yn dadlau bod ontoleg — a ddiystyriwyd unwaith fel un anymarferol — wedi dod yn seilwaith cynhaliol ar gyfer dibynadwyedd AI: mae rhithweledigaeth model iaith fawr wedi dinoethi haen goll o “ystyr”, ac mae ontolegau pragmataidd, wedi'u mewnblannu, bellach yn gweithredu fel cadwynau diogelwch sy'n angori allbwn tebygolegol wrth weithred atebol.",
  "Artificial Intelligence and Legal Personhood: Ethical, Regulatory, and Accountability Challenges in Contemporary Jurisprudence": "Artificial Intelligence and Legal Personhood: Ethical, Regulatory, and Accountability Challenges in Contemporary Jurisprudence",
  "Artificial Persons": "Personau Artiffisial",
  "At the UN’s inaugural Global Dialogue on AI Governance in Geneva, Secretary-General António Guterres called for coordinated worldwide rules covering everything from child-safety obligations on AI developers to limits on unsafe autonomous weapons, warning that unchecked AI could deepen inequality between rich and poor nations.": "Yng Nghyfarfod Byd-eang cyntaf y Cenhedloedd Unedig ar Lywodraethu AI yn Genefa, galwodd yr Ysgrifennydd Cyffredinol António Guterres am reolau byd-eang cydgysylltiedig sy'n cwmpasu popeth o rwymedigaethau diogelwch plant ar ddatblygwyr AI i gyfyngiadau ar arfau ymreolaethol anniogel, gan rybuddio y gallai AI heb ei reoli ddyfnhau anghydraddoldeb rhwng gwledydd cyfoethog a thlawd.",
