  "Eight more /topics entries, this time researched by an AI agent rather than curated by hand — same rule as before: every source fetched and confirmed live, summaries an original paraphrase, before anything gets added. 14 entries total.": "Wyth cofnod arall yn /topics, y tro hwn wedi'u hymchwilio gan asiant AI yn hytrach na'u curadu â llaw — yr un rheol ag o'r blaen: pob ffynhonnell wedi'i nôl a'i chadarnhau'n fyw, crynodebau'n aralleiriad gwreiddiol, cyn ychwanegu dim. 14 cofnod i gyd.",
