  "Fifteen languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi.": "Pymtheg iaith yn fyw i gyd: Saesneg, Tsieinëeg Draddodiadol, Tsieinëeg Symledig, Japaneeg, Corëeg, Ffrangeg, Almaeneg, Sbaeneg, Portiwgaleg, Rwseg, Arabeg, Twrceg, Perseg, Bengaleg, Hindi.",
